### 1. GET all items (Отримати список всіх елементів)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### 2. GET one item (Отримати елемент з ID 1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/1
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### 3. GET one item (Отримати елемент з ID 2)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/2
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### 4. POST create new item (Створити новий елемент)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New API Item",
  "description": "Created via HTTP client",
  "price": 100.50
}

### 5. PUT update existing item (Повністю оновити елемент з ID 1)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/1
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated API Item",
  "description": "Replaced completely",
  "price": 150.00
}

### 6. PATCH partially update item (Частково оновити елемент з ID 2)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/2
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 89.99
}

### 7. DELETE an item (Видалити елемент з ID 3)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/3
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### 8. GET items with pagination (Отримати список з пагінацією)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### 9. GET items with filter (Отримати відфільтрований список)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items?category=test
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### 10. GET non-existent item (Тест помилки 404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/99999
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json